{
  "name": "@wenbin_wb/dsh-bridge",
  "version": "2.9.0",
  "description": "手机扫码即可在移动端/公网继续用 DeepSeek Harness，人不在电脑前也能接着干。一键局域网二维码、Cloudflare 公网隧道、自建隧道与微信 / QQ / 飞书 / Telegram Bot（多工作区/会话持久化/媒体/卡片审批/流式输出），无需自己搭公网服务器。",
  "releaseNotes": "【v2.9.0 全面安全加固与代码质量大修】\n• 🔐 密码哈希 PBKDF2 升级至 600,000 次迭代（存量旧哈希登录时透明升级，无需重设密码）；管理密码解锁防爆破；未设密码时高危操作强制先设密码；loopback-token CORS 收敛；隧道令牌掩码不再覆盖真实值\n• 🐞 修复十余个稳定性问题：低版本 Node / iOS 16 浏览器发送消息报 AbortSignal 错误（自动兼容垫片）、微信收图必崩、QQ 流式兜底崩溃、面板升级命令渲染崩溃、IM 端收不到审批卡片（approval 瀑布归属模型重建，飞书按钮卡片同步修复）、/list 报 without inject 错误、卸载监听器泄漏、工具调用协议标记泄漏到聊天等\n• 🚦 出站消息串行队列消除乱序与 QQ msgSeq 竞态；审批发起者校验（群成员不可代批）；群聊授权改显式配置（默认关闭）；配置持久化事务化防丢失更新；解锁后自动续办被拦截操作；断开后重连不再强制扫码\n• 🧹 引入 eslint + CI 全矩阵测试（Node 22/24 × Linux/Windows）；conversation-bridge 按职责拆分四模块；平台装配工厂化；清理废弃端点与死代码；提交 package-lock.json",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "client",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "docs"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build:client": "node client/build.mjs",
    "build:lark": "node scripts/bundle-lark.mjs",
    "build:banner": "node scripts/generate-banner.mjs",
    "prepack": "npm run build:lark && npm run build:client",
    "release:github": "node scripts/create-github-release.mjs",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "qrcode": "^1.5.3",
    "ws": "^8.18.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": "0.1.0-rc.6",
    "@eslint/js": "^10.0.1",
    "@larksuiteoapi/node-sdk": "^1.73.0",
    "esbuild": "^0.25.9",
    "eslint": "^10.9.1",
    "globals": "^17.11.0",
    "puppeteer-core": "^25.8.0"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": ">=0.1.0-rc.6"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "remote",
    "remote-access",
    "tunnel",
    "cloudflare",
    "mobile",
    "smartphone",
    "tablet",
    "qr-code",
    "qrcode",
    "websocket",
    "bot",
    "wechat",
    "qq",
    "feishu",
    "telegram"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-layout",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/wenbin-wb/dsh-bridge.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/wenbin-wb/dsh-bridge/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/wenbin-wb/dsh-bridge",
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public",
    "registry": "https://registry.npmjs.org/"
  }
}
